atque in mss. Heumanni; unde vero, mihi non compertum:
sed hoc fere idem est quam  <HI REND="ITALIC">commodius.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="1065"><HI REND="ITALIC">Quia.</HI>  Ms. Taurin.  <HI REND="ITALIC">qui.</HI>  Caeteri, cum editis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="1065"><HI REND="ITALIC">Malle.</HI>  Ms. 1 Reg. rec. et editi,  <HI REND="ITALIC">velle.</HI>  Melius mss.
