 <COL N="1067A"></COL> <NOTE TYPE="Variorum Notae" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="1067"><COL N="1067C"></COL> [Variorum Notae to columns 1067-1068] <P COM="1067"><HI REND="ITALIC">His.</HI>  3 edit.  <HI REND="ITALIC">iis.</HI></P> 

