 <P COM="1085"><HI REND="ITALIC">Quoque.</HI>  Deest in ms. Taurin.</P> 

 <P COM="1085"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ratio subsistat.</HI>  Vide not. ad l. VII, cap. 3. Recte
Pfaffius in notis ad me missis,  <HI REND="ITALIC">subsistat,</HI>  id est  <HI REND="ITALIC">constet.</HI></P> 

